  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t25",
   "x": 25,
   "y": 365,
   "width": 1070,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "KV cache: 16 layers x [B, 16 heads, Tmax, 64] preallocated, Tmax <= 3000 frames (240 s); attention reads 0..pos.\nBudget: < 80 ms per step. Stale mic blocks are dropped rather than drifting. mx.async_eval overlaps frame t+1 with t.\nWeight-only 8-bit / 4-bit quantisation for bandwidth-bound decoding.",
   "originalText": "KV cache: 16 layers x [B, 16 heads, Tmax, 64] preallocated, Tmax <= 3000 frames (240 s); attention reads 0..pos.\nBudget: < 80 ms per step. Stale mic blocks are dropped rather than drifting. mx.async_eval overlaps frame t+1 with t.\nWeight-only 8-bit / 4-bit quantisation for bandwidth-bound decoding.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
